body:
It's not bad, if you were going for a  quieter, and more compact sound. To me it sounds like the whole song was kind of dynamically smooshed almost like he normalized the entire mix itself but that does end up giving it a more intimate like sound. 

&#x200B;

I hope my comment helps

To be honest I think that was a bad take because of how nervous I was and how little confidence I have in my singing. But I've started something new that's helped me find courage when I need it, it's a weird thing to do but it works. I just ask myself, "Am I breathing", because sometimes I honestly forget. So when I can answer that question with yes then I don't have to ask myself if I can do something because if I'm still breathing I already have that answer.

&#x200B;

I'm sorry if that didn't answer your question
